So, if I understand you correctly, you plan to model the relationships
among the N=50 predictors? Sounds a bit like a path-analysis model. But
do you have apriori hypotheses on how these predictors are interrelated?
SEM is a confirmatory approach: you need a pre-specified model.

Yves.

